# Scripts

This folder contains Python scripts used in the AI-guided Hantaan virus
(HTNV) L-protein/RdRp inhibitor-discovery project.

## Workflow

1. Ligand preparation and virtual screening.
2. ADMET profiling and drug-likeness filtering.
3. Bemis–Murcko scaffold analysis.
4. Reaction-based analogue generation.
5. Scaffold hopping and candidate generation.
6. Molecular similarity analysis.
7. Docking-score analysis.
8. Residue-level interaction analysis.
9. Explainable AI analysis using SHAP and GNNExplainer.
10. Pharmacophore modeling and visualization.

## Important Note

All outputs are computational predictions and are hypothesis-generating only.
No molecular-dynamics simulations or experimental validation were performed
in the present study.
